title Village Storefront - Component Overview\n(Layered Modular Monolith Architecture)

legend top left
  **Icon Conventions:**
  [Component] = Quarkus module or logical boundary
  ((I)) = Interface/Contract
  [Ext] = External service/system
  --> Solid arrow = Direct dependency
  ..> Dotted arrow = Asynchronous/event flow

  **Documentation Anchors:**
  See docs/architecture_overview.md
    - #section-3-layered-modular-monolith
    - #section-4-tenant-isolation
  See .codemachine/artifacts/architecture/02_System_Structure_and_Data.md
    - #2-architectural-drivers (Section 2 narrative)
    - #3-proposed-architecture (module/technology stack)
  See docs/adr/ADR-001-tenancy.md
    - Shared database tenancy model
    - TenantContext propagation
endlegend

' ============================================================================
' PRESENTATION LAYER
' ============================================================================
package "Presentation Layer" as PresentationLayer #DDFFDD {

  component [Qute Storefront\nTemplates] as QuteStorefront #LightBlue
  note right of QuteStorefront
    Customer-facing views
    All paths except /admin/*
    Server-side rendering
  end note

  component [Admin SPA\n(Vue.js 3 + Quinoa)] as AdminSPA #LightBlue
  note right of AdminSPA
    Merchant dashboard
    /admin/* routes
    Compiled via Quinoa
  end note

  component [REST API\n(/api/v1/*)] as RestAPI #LightBlue
  note right of RestAPI
    OpenAPI spec-first
    Package: api.rest
    DTOs in api.types
  end note
}

' ============================================================================
' TENANT ACCESS GATEWAY (Cross-cutting concern)
' ============================================================================
package "Tenant Access Gateway" as TenantGateway #FFE6CC {
  component [TenantResolutionFilter] as TenantFilter
  component [TenantContext\n(ThreadLocal)] as TenantContext
  database "Tenant Cache\n(Caffeine)" as TenantCache

  TenantFilter --> TenantContext : Set current tenant
  TenantFilter --> TenantCache : Lookup by domain

  note right of TenantGateway
    **anchor: section-4-tenant-isolation**
    Resolves tenant from Host header
    (subdomain or custom domain)
    Propagates tenant_id to all layers
    See ADR-001 for details
  end note
}

' ============================================================================
' SERVICE/DOMAIN LAYER (Logical Modules)
' ============================================================================
package "Service Layer - Logical Modules" as ServiceLayer #E6F3FF {

  ' INNER MODULES (no dependencies on outer modules)
  package "Tenancy Module" as TenancyModule #FFFFCC {
    component [TenantService] as TenantService
    component [CustomDomainService] as DomainService

    note bottom of TenancyModule
      **Core bounded context**
      Entities: Tenant, Store, CustomDomain
      No external module dependencies
    end note
  }

  package "Identity Module" as IdentityModule #FFFFCC {
    component [AuthService\n(JWT)] as AuthService
    component [SessionService] as SessionService
    component [ImpersonationService] as ImpersonationService

    note bottom of IdentityModule
      Entities: User, Session, Role, Permission
      Depends on: Tenancy
      Stateless JWT + session logging
    end note
  }

  ' MIDDLE MODULES
  package "Catalog Module" as CatalogModule #E6E6FF {
    component [ProductService] as ProductService
    component [InventoryService] as InventoryService
    component [CategoryService] as CategoryService

    note bottom of CatalogModule
      Entities: Product, Variant, Category, InventoryItem
      Depends on: Tenancy
    end note
  }

  package "Payments Module" as PaymentsModule #E6E6FF {
    component [PaymentService] as PaymentService
    component [StripeAdapter] as StripeAdapter
    component [RefundService] as RefundService

    note bottom of PaymentsModule
      Entities: Payment, Refund, PaymentMethod
      Depends on: Orders, Tenancy
      External: Stripe SDK
    end note
  }

  ' OUTER MODULES (depend on inner modules)
  package "Orders Module" as OrdersModule #FFE6E6 {
    component [CartService] as CartService
    component [CheckoutOrchestrator] as CheckoutService
    component [OrderService] as OrderService
    component [ShipmentService] as ShipmentService
    component [ReturnService] as ReturnService

    note bottom of OrdersModule
      Entities: Order, LineItem, Shipment, Return
      Depends on: Catalog, Payments, Tenancy
      Orchestrates checkout flow
    end note
  }

  package "Consignment Module" as ConsignmentModule #FFE6E6 {
    component [VendorService] as VendorService
    component [CommissionService] as CommissionService
    component [PayoutService] as PayoutService

    note bottom of ConsignmentModule
      Entities: Vendor, Commission, Payout
      Depends on: Catalog, Orders, Payments
    end note
  }

  package "Notifications Module" as NotificationsModule #FFE6E6 {
    component [EmailService] as EmailService
    component [WebhookService] as WebhookService
    component [DelayedJobWorker] as JobWorker

    note bottom of NotificationsModule
      Entities: DelayedJob, EmailTemplate
      Depends on: All other modules (observes events)
      Background processing
    end note
  }

  package "Loyalty Module" as LoyaltyModule #E6E6FF {
    component [LoyaltyService] as LoyaltyService
    component [GiftCardService] as GiftCardService
    component [StoreCreditService] as StoreCreditService

    note bottom of LoyaltyModule
      Entities: LoyaltyProgram, GiftCard, StoreCredit
      Depends on: Orders, Payments, Tenancy
      Phase 2+ extensibility
    end note
  }

  package "POS Module" as POSModule #E6E6FF {
    component [POSService] as POSService
    component [OfflineSyncService] as OfflineSyncService

    note bottom of POSModule
      Entities: POSTransaction, OfflineBlob
      Depends on: Orders, Catalog, Payments
      Encrypted offline replay
    end note
  }

  package "Media Module" as MediaModule #FFE6E6 {
    component [MediaService] as MediaService
    component [ImageProcessor] as ImageProcessor
    component [VideoTranscoder] as VideoTranscoder

    note bottom of MediaModule
      Entities: Media, MediaVariant
      Depends on: Tenancy
      FFmpeg + Thumbnailator processing
    end note
  }

  package "Platform-Ops Module" as PlatformOpsModule #FFFFCC {
    component [FeatureFlagService] as FeatureFlagService
    component [AuditLogService] as AuditLogService
    component [ReportingService] as ReportingService

    note bottom of PlatformOpsModule
      Entities: FeatureFlag, AuditLog, Report
      Cross-cutting concerns
      Kill switches + observability
    end note
  }

  ' CDI Event Bus (Cross-cutting)
  component [CDI Event Bus] as EventBus #FFCCCC
  note right of EventBus
    TenantResolved, TenantMissing events
    Decouples tenant resolution from
    feature flags, auditing, observability
  end note
}

' ============================================================================
' INFRASTRUCTURE LAYER
' ============================================================================
package "Infrastructure Layer" as InfraLayer #F0F0F0 {
  database "PostgreSQL\n(Shared Schema)" as PostgreSQL
  note right of PostgreSQL
    All tables include tenant_id
    Composite unique constraints + RLS policies
    Partitioned session/audit tables
    See ADR-001 shared database model
  end note

  queue "Background Job Queue\n(DelayedJob Tables)" as JobQueue
  note right of JobQueue
    Database-backed job queue
    Handles: emails, payouts, media work,
    reporting, cleanup
    No external broker dependency
  end note

  package "Worker Pods" as WorkerPods #E0E0E0 {
    component [Media Worker] as MediaWorker
    component [Report Worker] as ReportWorker
    component [Payout Worker] as PayoutWorker
    component [Scheduled Maintenance] as MaintenanceWorker

    note bottom of WorkerPods
      Quarkus Scheduler-driven workers
      Process DelayedJob queue items
      Scale independently via replicas
    end note
  }

  database "Caffeine Cache\n(In-Memory)" as CaffeineCache
  note right of CaffeineCache
    Product fragments, rate limits,
    feature flags, tenant metadata
    No Redis dependency
  end note
}

' ============================================================================
' EXTERNAL SYSTEMS
' ============================================================================
cloud "Stripe API\n(Payments + Connect)" as Stripe #FFD700
cloud "Email Provider\n(SMTP/Mailpit)" as Mailer #FFD700
cloud "Cloudflare R2\n(S3-Compatible)" as ObjectStorage #FFD700
cloud "Shipping APIs\n(UPS/FedEx/USPS)" as ShippingAPIs #FFD700
cloud "FFmpeg\n(Media Processing)" as FFmpeg #FFD700
cloud "Address Validation\n(SmartyStreets/USPS)" as AddressValidation #FFD700

' ============================================================================
' OBSERVABILITY & OPERATIONS
' ============================================================================
package "Observability Stack" as ObservabilityStack #E6F7FF {
  component [OpenTelemetry\nCollector] as OTelCollector
  component [Prometheus] as Prometheus
  component [Jaeger] as Jaeger
  component [Grafana\nDashboards] as Grafana
  component [Structured\nJSON Logging] as StructuredLogging

  note bottom of ObservabilityStack
    Tenant-aware tracing + metrics
    Liveness/readiness probes
    Audit trail for RISK-001/002
    See: docs/operations/observability.md
  end note
}

package "CI/CD & Runtime Platform" as CICDPlatform #FFF4E6 {
  component [GitHub Actions] as GitHubActions
  component [Kubernetes\n(k3s Cluster)] as Kubernetes
  component [Container Registry] as Registry

  note bottom of CICDPlatform
    Native image builds (GraalVM)
    Kubernetes extension generates manifests
    <100ms cold start, 50-100MB images
  end note
}

' ============================================================================
' PRESENTATION -> GATEWAY DEPENDENCIES
' ============================================================================
QuteStorefront --> TenantFilter : HTTP Request
AdminSPA --> TenantFilter : HTTP Request
RestAPI --> TenantFilter : HTTP Request

' ============================================================================
' GATEWAY -> INNER MODULES & CDI EVENTS
' ============================================================================
TenantContext ..> TenantService : Get tenant metadata
TenantContext ..> IdentityModule : Propagate tenant_id
TenantFilter ..> EventBus : Emit TenantResolved
EventBus ..> FeatureFlagService : Load feature snapshot
EventBus ..> AuditLogService : Log tenant access

' ============================================================================
' MODULE DEPENDENCIES (Following Dependency Rule)
' ============================================================================

' Presentation -> Services
QuteStorefront --> CatalogModule : Display products
QuteStorefront --> OrdersModule : Checkout
AdminSPA --> IdentityModule : Authentication
AdminSPA --> CatalogModule : Manage products
AdminSPA --> OrdersModule : View orders
AdminSPA --> ConsignmentModule : Vendor management
RestAPI --> CatalogModule
RestAPI --> OrdersModule
RestAPI --> IdentityModule

' Identity depends on Tenancy
IdentityModule --> TenancyModule : Tenant-scoped users

' Catalog depends on Tenancy
CatalogModule --> TenancyModule : Tenant-scoped products

' Payments depends on Tenancy
PaymentsModule --> TenancyModule : Tenant-scoped payments

' Orders depends on Catalog, Payments, Tenancy
OrdersModule --> CatalogModule : Product/inventory lookup
OrdersModule --> PaymentsModule : Process payments
OrdersModule --> TenancyModule : Tenant-scoped orders

' Consignment depends on Catalog, Orders, Payments
ConsignmentModule --> CatalogModule : Vendor products
ConsignmentModule --> OrdersModule : Commission calculation
ConsignmentModule --> PaymentsModule : Vendor payouts

' Notifications observes all modules (event-driven)
NotificationsModule ..> OrdersModule : Order events
NotificationsModule ..> PaymentsModule : Payment events
NotificationsModule ..> ConsignmentModule : Payout events

' Loyalty depends on Orders, Payments
LoyaltyModule --> OrdersModule : Reward on purchase
LoyaltyModule --> PaymentsModule : Gift card/credit payments

' POS depends on Orders, Catalog, Payments
POSModule --> OrdersModule : Create in-store orders
POSModule --> CatalogModule : Inventory lookup
POSModule --> PaymentsModule : Process payments

' Media depends on Tenancy
MediaModule --> TenancyModule : Tenant-scoped media

' Platform-Ops spans all modules (cross-cutting)
PlatformOpsModule ..> TenancyModule : Feature flags per tenant
PlatformOpsModule ..> IdentityModule : Audit user actions

' ============================================================================
' INFRASTRUCTURE DEPENDENCIES
' ============================================================================
TenantService --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations
IdentityModule --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations
CatalogModule --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations
OrdersModule --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations
PaymentsModule --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations
ConsignmentModule --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations
NotificationsModule --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations
LoyaltyModule --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations
POSModule --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations
MediaModule --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations
PlatformOpsModule --> PostgreSQL : CRUD operations

' Cache dependencies
TenantCache --> CaffeineCache : Store tenant metadata
FeatureFlagService --> CaffeineCache : Cache flag state
CatalogModule --> CaffeineCache : Product fragments

' Object storage
CatalogModule --> ObjectStorage : Product images
MediaModule --> ObjectStorage : Media variants

' Background job processing
NotificationsModule --> JobQueue : Enqueue jobs
ConsignmentModule --> JobQueue : Enqueue payout jobs
MediaModule --> JobQueue : Enqueue media jobs
ReportingService --> JobQueue : Enqueue report jobs
JobWorker --> JobQueue : Consume jobs

' Worker pod processing
MediaWorker --> JobQueue : Process media tasks
ReportWorker --> JobQueue : Generate reports
PayoutWorker --> JobQueue : Execute payouts
MaintenanceWorker --> PostgreSQL : Cleanup/archival

' ============================================================================
' EXTERNAL SYSTEM DEPENDENCIES
' ============================================================================
StripeAdapter --> Stripe : Payment processing + webhooks
PayoutService --> Stripe : Vendor payouts via Connect
EmailService --> Mailer : Send emails
ShipmentService --> ShippingAPIs : Generate labels
ShipmentService --> AddressValidation : Validate addresses
VideoTranscoder --> FFmpeg : Video processing
ImageProcessor --> FFmpeg : Thumbnail generation

' Observability integrations
ServiceLayer ..> OTelCollector : Emit traces/metrics
InfraLayer ..> OTelCollector : Emit traces/metrics
OTelCollector --> Prometheus : Export metrics
OTelCollector --> Jaeger : Export traces
Prometheus --> Grafana : Visualize metrics
Jaeger --> Grafana : Visualize traces
ServiceLayer ..> StructuredLogging : JSON logs

' CI/CD & Deployment
GitHubActions --> Registry : Push container images
Kubernetes --> Registry : Pull images
Kubernetes ..> Prometheus : Scrape metrics
Kubernetes ..> ServiceLayer : Liveness/readiness probes

' ============================================================================
' FLOW ANNOTATIONS
' ============================================================================
note as Flow1
  **Flow 1: Customer Purchase (Storefront)**
  1. Browser → Qute Storefront (product page)
  2. TenantResolutionFilter resolves tenant
  3. TenantContext propagates tenant_id
  4. CatalogService fetches product (tenant-scoped)
  5. CheckoutOrchestrator coordinates:
     - InventoryService (reserve stock)
     - PaymentService → StripeAdapter (charge)
     - OrderService (create order record)
  6. EmailService → JobQueue (send confirmation)
  **Anchors:**
  - docs/architecture_overview.md#section-3-layered-architecture
  - docs/architecture_overview.md#section-4-tenant-isolation
  - docs/adr/ADR-001-tenancy.md
end note

note as Flow2
  **Flow 2: Admin Vendor Management**
  1. Admin SPA → REST API (/api/v1/admin/vendors)
  2. TenantResolutionFilter resolves tenant
  3. AuthService validates JWT + permissions
  4. VendorService creates vendor (tenant-scoped)
  5. CommissionService calculates splits
  6. WebhookService notifies vendor (async)
  **Anchors:**
  - docs/architecture_overview.md#section-3-layered-architecture
  - docs/architecture_overview.md#module-boundaries-logical
  - docs/adr/ADR-001-tenancy.md
end note

note as Flow3
  **Flow 3: Background Media Processing (Queues + Feature Flags)**
  1. Admin uploads video via MediaService
  2. MediaService checks feature flag: tenant.media.video_processing
  3. FeatureFlagService reads from Caffeine cache (fallback: PostgreSQL)
  4. MediaService enqueues DelayedJob → JobQueue (PostgreSQL table)
  5. MediaWorker polls JobQueue, acquires lock
  6. VideoTranscoder invokes FFmpeg (external process)
  7. Processed variants uploaded to R2 with signed URLs
  8. OpenTelemetry traces span across all steps (tenant_id tag)
  9. Prometheus metrics: job_processing_duration_seconds
  10. Structured JSON logs written with tenant context
  **Key Components:**
  - **Feature Flags:** Kill switches for progressive rollout
  - **Queues:** Database-backed DelayedJob (no external broker)
  - **Observability:** OTel traces, Prometheus metrics, JSON logs
  **Anchors:**
  - docs/architecture/tenant_isolation.md#tenant-access-gateway
  - docs/operations/observability.md
  - docs/feature_flags/governance.md
end note

Flow1 .. QuteStorefront
Flow2 .. AdminSPA
Flow3 .. MediaModule

@enduml
